{"seq":2,"slug":"testflight","title":"TestFlight 内测分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-development/deployment/testflight","wordCount":1177,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"testflight-内测分发\">TestFlight 内测分发</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>TestFlight 是 Apple 官方的 Beta 测试平台，允许开发者将预发布版本分发给内部团队和外部测试用户。它是 App 提交 App Store 之前收集反馈、验证质量的核心环节。与 Ad Hoc 分发相比，TestFlight 不需要收集设备 UDID，外部测试最多支持 10,000 名测试人员。</p>\n<p>TestFlight 分为<strong>内部测试</strong>和<strong>外部测试</strong>两种模式。内部测试面向开发团队成员（最多 100 人），上传后即可安装，无需 Apple 审核；外部测试面向指定的测试人员或公开链接，首次提交需要经过 Beta App Review。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    BUILD[&quot;Build Archive Archive&quot;] --&gt; UPLOAD[&quot;Upload to App Store Connect&quot;]&#10;    UPLOAD --&gt; PROCESS[&quot;Apple Process Build&quot;]&#10;    PROCESS --&gt; INTERNAL[&quot;Internal Testing (≤100People)&quot;]&#10;    PROCESS --&gt; EXTERNAL[&quot;External Testing (≤10,000People)&quot;]&#10;    EXTERNAL --&gt; REVIEW[&quot;Beta App Review&quot;]&#10;    REVIEW --&gt; DIST[&quot;Distribute to Testers&quot;]&#10;    INTERNAL --&gt; INSTALL[&quot;Testers Install&quot;]&#10;    DIST --&gt; INSTALL&#10;    INSTALL --&gt; FEEDBACK[&quot;Collect Feedback&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    BUILD[\"Build Archive Archive\"] --&gt; UPLOAD[\"Upload to App Store Connect\"]\n    UPLOAD --&gt; PROCESS[\"Apple Process Build\"]\n    PROCESS --&gt; INTERNAL[\"Internal Testing (≤100People)\"]\n    PROCESS --&gt; EXTERNAL[\"External Testing (≤10,000People)\"]\n    EXTERNAL --&gt; REVIEW[\"Beta App Review\"]\n    REVIEW --&gt; DIST[\"Distribute to Testers\"]\n    INTERNAL --&gt; INSTALL[\"Testers Install\"]\n    DIST --&gt; INSTALL\n    INSTALL --&gt; FEEDBACK[\"Collect Feedback\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>TestFlight 是 App Store 之前的 <strong>Beta 分发通道</strong>，核心是区分<strong>内外部测试</strong>并理解各自的门槛与流程。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>内部 vs 外部</strong>：内部（≤100 人）免审核即时可用，外部（≤10,000 人）首次需 Beta App Review</li>\n<li><strong>构建号必须递增</strong>：每次上传都要提升 <code>CFBundleVersion</code></li>\n<li><strong>有效期约束</strong>：构建有效期 90 天，需定期更新</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">维度</th>\n<th align=\"left\">内部测试</th>\n<th align=\"left\">外部测试</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\">人数上限</td>\n<td align=\"left\">100</td>\n<td align=\"left\">10,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">是否需要审核</td>\n<td align=\"left\">否</td>\n<td align=\"left\">首次需要 Beta Review</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\">邀请方式</td>\n<td align=\"left\">团队成员</td>\n<td align=\"left\">指定邮箱或公开链接</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"核心工具\">核心工具</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Xcode (Archive + Upload)</strong></td>\n<td>GUI 方式构建并上传</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>xcodebuild</strong></td>\n<td>命令行 Archive 和导出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>altool / notarytool</strong></td>\n<td>命令行上传到 App Store Connect</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Transporter.app</strong></td>\n<td>Apple 官方上传工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>fastlane pilot</strong></td>\n<td>自动化 TestFlight 管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>App Store Connect</strong></td>\n<td>管理构建、测试组、测试人员</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工作流程\">工作流程</h2><h3 id=\"步骤一-构建-archive\">步骤一：构建 Archive</h3><p>通过 Xcode GUI 或命令行创建 Archive：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"xcodebuild archive \\&#10;  -workspace MyApp.xcworkspace \\&#10;  -scheme MyApp \\&#10;  -configuration Release \\&#10;  -archivePath ./build/MyApp.xcarchive \\&#10;  -destination &quot;generic/platform=iOS&quot; \\&#10;  DEVELOPMENT_TEAM=ABCDEF1234 \\&#10;  CODE_SIGN_STYLE=Manual \\&#10;  PROVISIONING_PROFILE_SPECIFIER=&quot;MyApp_AppStore&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">xcodebuild</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> archive</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -workspace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> MyApp.xcworkspace</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -scheme</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> MyApp</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -configuration</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Release</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -archivePath</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./build/MyApp.xcarchive</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -destination</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"generic/platform=iOS\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  DEVELOPMENT_TEAM=ABCDEF1234</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  CODE_SIGN_STYLE=Manual</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  PROVISIONING_PROFILE_SPECIFIER=\"MyApp_AppStore\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"步骤二-导出-ipa\">步骤二：导出 IPA</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"xcodebuild -exportArchive \\&#10;  -archivePath ./build/MyApp.xcarchive \\&#10;  -exportPath ./build/ipa \\&#10;  -exportOptionsPlist ExportOptions.plist\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">xcodebuild</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -exportArchive</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -archivePath</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./build/MyApp.xcarchive</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -exportPath</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./build/ipa</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -exportOptionsPlist</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ExportOptions.plist</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ExportOptions.plist 配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&gt;&#10;&lt;!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC &quot;-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN&quot;&#10;  &quot;http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd&quot;&gt;&#10;&lt;plist version=&quot;1.0&quot;&gt;&#10;&lt;dict&gt;&#10;    &lt;key&gt;method&lt;/key&gt;&#10;    &lt;string&gt;app-store&lt;/string&gt;&#10;    &lt;key&gt;teamID&lt;/key&gt;&#10;    &lt;string&gt;ABCDEF1234&lt;/string&gt;&#10;    &lt;key&gt;uploadSymbols&lt;/key&gt;&#10;    &lt;true/&gt;&#10;    &lt;key&gt;uploadBitcode&lt;/key&gt;&#10;    &lt;false/&gt;&#10;&lt;/dict&gt;&#10;&lt;/plist&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;?</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">xml</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> encoding</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"UTF-8\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">?></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;!</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DOCTYPE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> plist</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PUBLIC \"-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  \"http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">plist</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>method&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>app-store&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>teamID&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>ABCDEF1234&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>uploadSymbols&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>uploadBitcode&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">plist</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"步骤三-上传构建\">步骤三：上传构建</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"xcrun altool --upload-app \\&#10;  -f ./build/ipa/MyApp.ipa \\&#10;  -t ios \\&#10;  -u &quot;ci@myteam.com&quot; \\&#10;  -p &quot;@keychain:AC_PASSWORD&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">xcrun</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> altool</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --upload-app</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./build/ipa/MyApp.ipa</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ios</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -u</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"ci@myteam.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"@keychain:AC_PASSWORD\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"步骤四-配置测试组\">步骤四：配置测试组</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;App Store Connect&quot;&#10;        direction TB&#10;        BLD[&quot;Build Version&quot;] --&gt; IG[&quot;Internal Test Group&quot;]&#10;        BLD --&gt; EG[&quot;External Test Group&quot;]&#10;        IG --&gt; M1[&quot;Developer 1&quot;]&#10;        IG --&gt; M2[&quot;Developer 2&quot;]&#10;        EG --&gt; G1[&quot;QA Test Group&quot;]&#10;        EG --&gt; G2[&quot;Public Link&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"App Store Connect\"\n        direction TB\n        BLD[\"Build Version\"] --&gt; IG[\"Internal Test Group\"]\n        BLD --&gt; EG[\"External Test Group\"]\n        IG --&gt; M1[\"Developer 1\"]\n        IG --&gt; M2[\"Developer 2\"]\n        EG --&gt; G1[\"QA Test Group\"]\n        EG --&gt; G2[\"Public Link\"]\n    end</pre><p><strong>内部测试</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>最多 100 名测试人员（必须是 App Store Connect 用户）</li>\n<li>上传后立即可用，无需 Apple 审核</li>\n<li>适合开发团队日常验证</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>外部测试</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>最多 10,000 名测试人员</li>\n<li>可通过邮箱邀请或公开链接加入</li>\n<li>首次提交或重大更新需要 Beta App Review（通常 24-48 小时）</li>\n<li>支持多个测试组，每组可分配不同构建版本</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"版本管理\">版本管理</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>CFBundleShortVersionString</strong></td>\n<td>用户可见的版本号（如 1.2.0）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>CFBundleVersion</strong></td>\n<td>构建号（如 42），每次上传必须递增</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>有效期</strong></td>\n<td>构建上传后 90 天过期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>自动更新</strong></td>\n<td>测试人员的 TestFlight App 可自动安装最新构建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"fastlane-pilot-自动化\">fastlane pilot 自动化</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ruby\" data-code=\"# Fastfile&#10;lane :beta do&#10;  increment_build_number&#10;  build_app(&#10;    workspace: &quot;MyApp.xcworkspace&quot;,&#10;    scheme: &quot;MyApp&quot;,&#10;    export_method: &quot;app-store&quot;&#10;  )&#10;  upload_to_testflight(&#10;    skip_waiting_for_build_processing: false,&#10;    distribute_external: true,&#10;    groups: [&quot;QA Team&quot;, &quot;Stakeholders&quot;],&#10;    changelog: &quot;修复了登录页面的崩溃问题\\n优化了列表加载性能&quot;&#10;  )&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Fastfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lane </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">:beta</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  increment_build_number</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  build_app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    workspace:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"MyApp.xcworkspace\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    scheme:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"MyApp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    export_method:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"app-store\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line